---
<section class="cta" id="descargar">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-inner">
            <div class="cta-text">
                <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Únete a la manada</span>
                <h2>Descarga la app y empieza a <span class="accent">consentir</span> como se debe.</h2>
                <p>Disponible en iOS y Android. Crea el perfil de tu peludito en menos de 2 minutos y empieza a disfrutar todos los beneficios de Michicondrias.</p>
                <div class="cta-actions">
                    <a href="#" class="store-btn">
                        <span class="store-icon">🍎</span>
                        <span><small>Descargar en</small><strong>App Store</strong></span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="#" class="store-btn">
                        <span class="store-icon">▶️</span>
                        <span><small>Descargar en</small><strong>Google Play</strong></span>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <small class="cta-small">⭐ 4.9/5 · +50k descargas este mes</small>
            </div>
            <div class="cta-visual">
                <div class="phone-mock">
                    <div class="phone-notch"></div>
                    <div class="phone-screen">
                        <div class="phone-app-bar">
                            <span>🐾 Michicondrias</span>
                            <span>🔔</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="phone-greeting">
                            <h4>Hola, Andrea 👋</h4>
                            <p>¿Cómo está Michi hoy?</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="phone-pet">
                            <div class="phone-pet-pic">🐱</div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>Michi</strong>
                                <small>12.4 kg · Saludable</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="phone-grid">
                            <div class="phone-tile"><span>🛒</span>Tienda</div>
                            <div class="phone-tile"><span>🩺</span>Salud</div>
                            <div class="phone-tile"><span>📡</span>GPS</div>
                            <div class="phone-tile"><span>📢</span>Alertas</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
